'''Laser''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Gun Box 3]] or through [[trading]]. 

== Appearance ==
Its appearance is based on a real-life laser tag gun, hence the name. It has a small black trigger, and the bottom of the gun handle has an extra red detail. The main body of the gun has red streaks on it.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/212296936/Red-Hyperlaser-Gun Red Hyperlaser Gun], purchasable from the avatar shop for 650 Robux.
* It partners with the godly knife [[Slasher]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Slasher Set|Slasher Set]].
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Laser]], which can be found in the same box.
*When salvaged, it provides 30 godly [[shards]].

